/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*-----------------------*\
  Case-local PARTIAL overlay of the standard nitromethane record: the UNIFAC
  decomposition only.  The Hansen triple is now the catalogue record's own
  (DEV.md 4c C428: Hansen 1967 thesis Table 2.1 row 39, cross-read on
  Hansen 1969 Table I row N03), so it is no longer repeated here; acetone and
  n-hexane are read from the catalogue entirely.
  `overlayOf nitromethane;` declares this a DELTA -- the reader deep-merges it over
  data/standards/components/nitromethane.dat, so MW, Vliq, the vapour pressure,
  the Hansen triple and everything else keep coming from the standard.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
overlayOf nitromethane;
variationReason "adds the UNIFAC group decomposition, which the catalogue record lacks; the blends' phase check reads it";

//  The molecule IS its nitro subgroup (Hansen, Rasmussen, Fredenslund,
//  Schiller & Gmehling, Ind. Eng. Chem. Res. 30 (1991) 2352, the subgroup
//  table the engine's parameters/UNIFAC/groups.dat carries).
groups
{
    unifac ( { group CH3NO2; count 1; } );
}
